  "summary": "The TSM400-4-CP is a Teracom wall-mount NDIR CO2 and barometric pressure sensor with Modbus RTU over RS-485. CO2 in ppm and pressure in hPa or mmHg are given as floats and 16-bit integers, with trim registers.",
  "transport": [
    "RTU"
  ],
